│ patch_description        │ Per the recommendation: increase k_paths to 16 candidates per destination, drop the       │
│                          │ load-based score re-sorting, and rank candidates purely by path cost.                     │
│                          │ shortest_simple_paths already yields paths in ascending cost order, so we avoid           │
│                          │ re-sorting and use a cost-based early-exit (stop generating once a candidate exceeds 3x   │
