│                          │ prefer already-paid trunks, (2) adds an outer refinement loop (2 extra passes) where      │
│                          │ used_edges from the previous pass seed the next routing pass, letting the tree            │
│                          │ restructure toward cheaper shared trunks, and (3) evaluates both orderings (by base       │
│                          │ shortest-path cost and reverse) and keeps the pass producing the lowest total unique-edge │
│                          │ cost.                                                                                     │
